t to us-east, us-west, and eu-west.\n- Verified post-rollback: payments-worker is now **healthy**, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incidents**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, paged on-call) \u2014 mistakenly scoped to payments-api before the correction.\n- Opened **INC-0002** (SEV2, paged on-call) correctly scoped to payments-worker, noting the v3.4.0 regression, the rollback to v3.3.0, and that INC-0001 was opened in error.\n\nRecommend closing INC-0001 as a duplicate/mis-scoped incident.", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": []}]}